"title_0" = "Is there any reason to be concerned about your health";
"title_1" = "How do you overcome your fears";
"title_2" = "Will you ever be happy";
"title_3" = "Old Guilt and Resentment";
"title_4" = "An old feeling of sadness and depression";
"title_5" = "Former Health Issues";
"title_6" = "Do you need medical attention";
"title_7" = "Will your physical health affect your financial situation";
"title_8" = "Will a spiritual search help in solving health problems";
"title_9" = "Grand Total";

"fool_financial" = "The jester says that you have excellent health, you are young in soul and body. If you have a chronic disease, then the card says either that it is gone, or that you now have a great chance to leave this disease in the past.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "The magician portends you a favorable outcome if you have health problems. You will overcome any disease that has hampered your movement. If you are healthy, then the card says that you are full of strength and energy resources for any kind of difficult circumstances. Do not waste time in vain, your state is at the peak of activity, direct it in the right direction.";
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "The high priestess may indicate the hormonal nature of a disorder or illness. The card is responsible for memory, memories, sleep and mood swings, and if there are certain problems at the moment, they can be associated either with hormonal imbalance or with magical effects on your health and condition. The presence of this card can also indicate that the work of a healer will help in your condition, or you yourself are one.";
"empressCard_financial" = "You are expected to rise in vitality, the opportunity to relax your body and soul, recharge with new energies. Long life, excellent health. The card also very accurately indicates pregnancy, upcoming or recent childbirth. Therefore, if there were problems with conceiving a child, you can prepare for this process, higher powers favor you. If the card is a significator of the disease, then it is most likely a cyst or tumor - the body grows too much, cherishes pathological processes, so it is worth being diagnosed by a doctor if there is any doubt in this matter.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "The emperor speaks of rebirth and strengthening, therefore it is considered an indicator of good health. If your health is weakened or there is a disease that worries you, sports, hardening and any form of strengthening your body can help you.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "The hierophant can indicate that joint diseases are likely, as well as susceptibility to diseases transmitted by airborne droplets. Weak places of the body - kidneys, ears, throat. The card advises you to try vegetarianism, yoga, meditation and any kind of healing that goes smoothly and harmoniously and has a certain kind of limitation in anything. You should choose calm sports and recreation.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "The Lovers card indicates good health to you. She hints to you that if you need recovery, the best medicine for a person is another person, so try to enlist the support and care of a loved one who loves you and your well-being will become much better.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "The chariot is an indicator of good health and vitality. It is equally good for body and spirit. If you decide to go in for sports or quit an old bad habit, the results are amazing with due will and self-discipline. This card helps to practice a stricter lifestyle, diet, exercise, and any restrictions designed to cleanse and improve.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "The card speaks of a large supply of vital energy within you. Good health, an obedient body, the right instincts, good physical shape - all this can be directly your merit. If you are sick, the card speaks of vitality, vitality, recovery and restoration of your strength, you will definitely get better, provided you find balance and calmness within yourself.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "The hermit speaks of a decline in energy, a decrease in vitality, a gradual curtailment of the activity of vital functions. This is a map of descent into the depths and movement inwards. In its most classic form, it corresponds to the processes of natural aging. But it can also be exhaustion after overload and the need to save the remaining forces.";
"wheelOfFortune_financial" = "You have quite good health on this card, but with elements of cyclicity. That is, your well-being can reach the peak of prosperity and the rise of your strength and again fall into exhaustion, subsequently rising again.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "Justice restores balance and teaches you how to keep your health in order. If you feel unwell or get sick, then this is the result of a not quite competent attitude towards your body. The map can indicate all sorts of tests, examinations, diagnoses, accurate medical reports, hospitalizations and operations.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "The hanged man is one of the indicators of a sick person. She can talk about chronic diseases, mental disorders, all kinds of addictions related to being in an altered consciousness under the influence of, say, psychotropic substances or alcohol intoxication. Also, the hanged man may indicate the course of a sluggish disease. In general, in any case, it is worth diagnosing your condition if you do not know the good reasons for feeling unwell.";
"deathCard_financial" = "This card can talk about quite serious health disorders: operations, heart attacks, chronic or incurable diseases, in more rare cases - coma, clinical death. Death rarely means actual physical death. Basically, she says that something has become obsolete and has ceased to function.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "The card speaks of your maintenance and balance within yourself as a physical and spiritual part of your life. This is a card of healing and rebirth and signifies wellness or recovery. You will be able to find in yourself a state of balance of your well-being.";
"devilCard_financial" = "You may be in the grip of an obsession, fear, or other strong emotion that affects you destructively. You may be confronted with darker aspects of your personality, which can bring about a mental imbalance. This is a test for you, which can be an impetus for acceptance of your rebellious nature. The card may indicate that you have addictions that destroy you.";
"towerCard_financial" = "The tower speaks of diseases and injuries that have fallen on you unexpectedly. If you at least approximately describe the entire bouquet, you can list endlessly: fractures, burns, high fever, vomiting, purulent abscesses, heart attacks, strokes, heart attacks, appendicitis, cyst rupture and other unpleasant things, often these are unexpected injuries. Sometimes this card can even talk about radiation damage, death or severe injuries in car or plane crashes, in a fire.";
"starCard_financial" = "The card either tells you about your wonderful state of health, or about the healing, healing and rejuvenation of the body, as well as the complete elimination of an existing disease that could have bothered you for a very long time. The card gives you hope that you will definitely get better and everything will be fine.";
"moonCard_financial" = "The moon can tell you about a serious psychological crisis, from which you can only get out with the help of a specialist. It can be either drug or alcohol addiction, or insomnia, nightmares, sleep disorders, paranoia, paralyzing fear, panic attacks, withdrawal after drug withdrawal, and sometimes problems with fluid exchange in the body. Also, the map may indicate genetic disorders.";
"sunCard_financial" = "The card says that in this period you are quite cheerful, have a high level of vitality, excellent physical shape and excellent mental state, and there is no reason to worry about your health. If you are sick during this period, then the Sun card promises you a complete recovery and an improvement in your condition and well-being.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "In the core, the Judgment card means an improvement in health, an influx of energy, recovery from a serious injury or illness. You may feel refreshed and restored. There is also a critical meaning of this card: if a person is on the verge of life and death, then it can unfortunately speak of a fatal outcome. Also, less common card meanings are seasickness, migraine, paranoia, an asthma attack, severe allergies, in general, a rather unpleasant state of health.";
"worldCard_financial" = "The world shows such excellent health that it simply cannot be better. If you are sick, then you will begin to recover from the illness. If you are sick with a very serious illness, the card, unfortunately, can be fatal. With this outcome, the World can report that you will get better very soon, but not in this world.";

