"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "This card for women can mark pregnancy, conception, the readiness of the body to bear and give birth to a child. He can also tell you about diseases that people usually get sick in childhood - chickenpox, rubella, diathesis.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates a temporary deterioration and harm to your health due to communication with an unsafe person, a brawler, or someone who constantly pumps up your emotions and harms others. Such a card also indicates minor difficulties, problems that may temporarily worsen your health, but not harm it much.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "You are in excellent physical health. Nothing bothers you and nothing threatens you. But this will last as long as attention is paid to the body. Any physical activity - walking, running, sports, etc. will bring definite benefits.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "You need to pay attention to your health. In this map, you cannot see specific diseases and the prognosis for the condition. It remains only to study the reasons for the state in which you find yourself. Also, the card may indicate the birth of a new life inside you - more specifically, pregnancy.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "You have endurance, good health, consistently good health, allowing you to easily engage in any business, including physical labor. Good physical shape, sound sleep, proper nutrition - you can be calm.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "The Knight of Swords symbolizes various mental disorders, such as schizophrenia, obsessions, delusions, insanity, as well as dependence on the Internet and computer games, when a person is completely immersed in a fictional reality that takes him far from real life. Often the map also includes accidents and injuries due to haste or negligence - as a result of a fall, speeding. Therefore, you should be more careful.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "The Knight of Wands is, in general, a card of good health, the ability to withstand heavy loads and trials. And also this is a sign of a fairly good libido.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "As a significator of the problem, the Knight of Cups can indicate, first of all, emotional disorders, all kinds of complexes and mental wounds (filled with alcohol, sleeping pills and other auxiliary drugs), as well as the instability of the affective sphere as such (throwing between depression and ecstasy).";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "The card speaks of good health, a stable mental and physical state, that you monitor your well-being, do not particularly trust traditional medicine, and tend to turn to proven traditional methods of treatment. You have everything under control, you will never miss the prescribed medical examination, seek medical help on time, but if necessary, before starting the treatment proposed by the doctor, you study and check everything yourself. The card may also portend pregnancy and easy delivery.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "The King of Swords indicates to you your ability to endure any pain. You probably don't want to take care of your own health. You can be prone to colds, various kinds of inflammation, osteochondrosis. Sometimes the card indicates a surgical intervention.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "The card indicates your good health, endurance, short temper and risk taking. It can indicate success in sports, finding a wise mentor or the right treatment that will help avoid recurrence of the disease, a rapid recovery and high internal potential.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates your excellent health, strength of body and spirit, ability to resist troubles and unpleasant surprises. She tells you about success in hardening and water procedures, mindfulness of one's health, sports and a healthy lifestyle.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "The card may indicate to you non-dangerous chronic diseases or illnesses due to improper lifestyle or nutrition, as well as diseases of the female body, diseases of the stomach, skin, which may require material costs for treatment and caution in the future so as not to cause exacerbation and dangerous symptoms of the disease.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "The card may indicate great danger and harm from a woman, in some cases it indicates surgery, a knife wound, a blow, a feminine danger. Such a card in any scenario portends major troubles and problems, for some people it predicts great difficulties and an exacerbation of the disease.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "The card indicates to you good health, a stable state, the absence of drastic changes, both for better and for worse. The card may indicate your athletic performance, stamina, and strength, but as you age, you may develop health conditions that may be associated with being overweight and sedentary.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates your beauty, vitality, desire for the birth of children, pregnancy and female happiness. It can mark your success in love, which will contribute to a quick recovery and good health. If we talk about information for men, the card may portend problems due to a woman, including those associated with male diseases.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates dangerous or chronic diseases due to disruption of the digestive organs, bad habits or deterioration of the body. Perhaps the treatment will require considerable financial investments, although if you are already sick, the card portends you to improve your condition and gain vitality and strength.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates dangerous or chronic diseases, heart attacks, strokes and gunshot wounds, knife wounds and a sudden deterioration in circumstances. Sometimes it also indicates the need for surgical intervention, a sharp exacerbation of the disease and a mortal danger to a person, an armed attack or serious injury. Therefore, be careful and prudent, take action.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "The card has good potential if you are healthy and well. Your health and circumstances will develop favorably for you. But in some cases, the card indicates diseases with a high temperature, viral infections, or danger from burns or fire. If you are sick at the moment and your health is not very good, the card portends a great danger due to fever and a dangerous infection, the peak of the disease has not yet been overcome, so you should be careful.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "The Tapo card of the Ace of Cups shows youth, mobility. It doesn't matter what age you are, you managed to maintain your health and strong immunity. According to the map, you can talk about your well-groomed pleasant appearance - healthy hair, nails, skin. The organs are working properly, you do not have serious chronic diseases. The Ace of Cups corresponds to the kidneys and the urinary system - it means the absence of problems with these organs.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "The map indicates an unstable period for you, strange symptoms and difficulties in making a diagnosis are possible. Such a card portends a period of difficulties and uncertainty, failures, which can lead to problems and fear, as health will not be stable and there may be symptoms of illness that will alternate with a period of well-being and well-being. Experience this moment with steadfastness and patience, do not aggravate the situation with anxiety, it will surely end.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates that you will have to go to a medical facility and undergo an examination. Habitual well-being may be disturbed, alarming symptoms of the disease may appear, or the habitual way of life may change. This card promises minor health problems or the gradual onset of a disease.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "A card of good health, great well-being and good, both physical and mental potential. This card indicates your excellent ability to recover, however, excessive mental stress can provoke headaches and deterioration in your well-being, constant worries and suffering due to overload, boredom and monotony in work.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates vitality, good health, optimistic mood and not prone to bad habits and fullness. However, in some cases, the card predicts a slow recovery if you are already sick and suffering. This card portends you to health with a moderate lifestyle and the absence of frills and immobility.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates an improvement in your situation, health and quick recovery from illness. If you are sick, the card portends a quick recovery or expensive treatment that will benefit. In addition, the card may indicate food allergies or skin conditions.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates that you will have to go to a medical facility and undergo an examination due to heart and worries. Sometimes the card says that you will be very worried about your condition and may suffer from illness or poor health, anxiety, uncertainty.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "The Three of Wands is a card of good health, excellent performance and strong immunity, which can successfully resist any disease. This card can portend an excess of vitality, empowerment, the ability to impress others with various tricks, good health and records of physical endurance and strength.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates prosperity, good health and enjoyment of life's blessings, but in some cases it warns you against the influence of alcohol, drunkenness and abuse of high-calorie dishes, so you should limit yourself to food. In addition, the card may portend diseases of the excretory system and kidneys.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates your excellent health, large body reserves, stability and constancy, however, in some cases, this card indicates diseases associated with greed, unwillingness to change lifestyle and vicious addictions, such as drunkenness or excess food.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates that you will have to change the usual order and follow the strict instructions of the doctor. It is possible that the disease will be delayed if you feel well, or that it will not be easy to get rid of the temperature increase. This card can promise losses and difficulties, delaying unpleasant circumstances for you.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "A card of good health, excellent physical shape, but sometimes such a card portends a loss of vitality and energy, slowness, worries and tears. This card may indicate the development of chronic diseases, the prolongation of illness, or worries due to the inability to quickly get to work due to complications after a cold.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates a long illness, both physical and mental nature, great experiences, tears, material losses, diseases of the kidneys, digestive and excretory systems, lack of demand and confusion. Such a card can also indicate to you feelings, tears and prolonged melancholy.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates to you rather poor health, lack of vitality, especially if at the moment you are seriously ill. It indicates a weak ability of the body to restore strength. If you are healthy, the card portends trouble due to material problems and losses, the consequences of fights and bad habits.";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates significant material losses, enmity and an unexpected blow from those whom you did not count on. Such a card speaks of hostility from others, manipulation, troubles associated with the fact that a dangerous and serious disease develops in the body.";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "The card speaks of struggles associated with both diseases, resistances or injuries resulting from attacks and scandals. A map of injuries, bruises, bruises, or viral infections that can attack the body and cause resistance. Sometimes such a card, if you are sick, indicates allergies, fever and the fight against viruses in the body, rejection of a medicine or medication.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates to you a long and dangerous, painful illness, both of a physical and mental nature, great worries, spending on treatment and unwillingness to see and hear anyone. The card may portend you a long exit from an active life, the acquisition of a chronic or inflammatory disease that can get you out of a rut for a long time.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates your excellent health, large reserves of the body, stability and constancy, however, in some cases, this card indicates diseases that are inherited by you, like bad habits, dangerous diseases, inferiority, or, conversely, good health, talent and genius.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates that you will have to change the usual order and follow strict instructions. In some cases, the card indicates hospitalization, material losses, a change of residence, which may be associated with a trip to a sanatorium or a change in the usual climate.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "A card of temporary improvement in health, strong potential and the ability to show leadership qualities in life. This card can tell you about a frivolous attitude towards your health, diseases of the stomach, liver, abuse of harmful foods, or the appearance of diseases that may be accompanied by a very high temperature.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates pregnancy for a woman, joy and a quick recovery from any illness. Sometimes this card portends a benign but contagious disease that will cause many problems and can lead to loneliness and isolation for a while. In addition, the card may indicate diseases that can be transmitted sexually or after several generations.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "As an indicator of health, the Seven of Pentacles is considered unfavorable. She speaks of the development of some kind of illness within you, the first symptoms of which will not appear soon, but you may miss the time for treatment. With such a map, we can talk about chronic fatigue, weakness, melancholy.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "The Seven of Swords speaks of the latent course of the disease, the beginning of some disease, the very beginning of the crisis. Psychologically, you are probably in a melancholy state.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "The card indicates that your immune system is quite strong, although it has to constantly fight off some infections. It can also speak of endocrine or hormonal problems, often associated with hyperfunction, a weak immune system, and a constant fight against infections.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "The card shows that you are currently in a rather unstable mental and emotional state, which can end in a nervous breakdown. Such a state can be accompanied by insomnia, when a swarm of thoughts interferes with turning off consciousness, nightmares, and in severe cases, delusions and hallucinations.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "The card tells you about the need to restore health after a long illness or injury. It shows that now you need to devote time to training, diet. This card warns you of possible overwork, as well as that you have overworked some organ. It can be heart, kidneys, headaches.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "A serious card when describing your health. It indicates that you are very limited, and this may be just a restriction in freedom - strict bed rest or a hospital room, or it may be limited in movement - serious injuries or even paralysis. The Eight of Swords indicates to you diseases associated with the application of bandages: injuries, inflammatory processes. Also, the card can tell you about the deterioration of vision. In addition, there may still be a problem with the psyche - phobias, obsessions, internal blocks.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "The Eight of Wands speaks of your increased energy, physical and emotional, which, ultimately, can lead you to chronic fatigue syndrome, as you are very nonchalant about rest. This card indicates hormonal surges. Sometimes it can talk about a critical increase in adrenaline in your blood, which eventually becomes an unbearable burden for the adrenal glands.";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "The Eight of Cups shows you in a state of complete exhaustion of vitality, lack of energy. You need rest, and sometimes even with a change of scenery. Exhaustion also occurs psychologically, which leads to depression, and sometimes suicidal thoughts. Suicide itself with such a card is impossible, because you do not have enough courage to commit such an act. Psychological problems can also manifest themselves in withdrawing from society when social phobia covers you. This is fraught with nervous tension and even going into a binge or narcotic ecstasy.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "The Nine of Pentacles tells you about stable, strong health as you take care of yourself, try to lead a healthy lifestyle, eat right and exercise your body. The card indicates to you a good opportunity to conceive a child.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "The card gives you a direct indication of the disease, and in all its manifestations. Here you can talk about serious physical problems, leading literally to strict bed rest and even to immobilization. Also, with such a card, you may have psychological problems: hysteria, depression, apathy, insomnia, nightmares.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "The Nine of Wands indicates problems with your head, namely injuries, such as a concussion. Also, this card can tell you about chronic fatigue, energy depletion, dulled attention.";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "As an indicator of health, this card is not unambiguous. On the one hand, it speaks of your complete peace of mind, the absence of illness or recovery after a protracted illness. On the other hand, it may indicate to you problems associated with excesses, such as overeating or drinking a lot of alcohol. This is a fairly common occurrence, since initially health allows you to go on a spree, but it just does not allow you to overdo it in this field.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "The Ten of Pentacles indicates excellent health. About such people, as you usually say: he is all in bloom and smells.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "Physically, you feel completely exhausted, exhausted, tired and exhausted. Ten of swords can also speak of fever and inflammation. Psychologically, you are accompanied by depression, even apathy, inner emptiness, loss of interest in the world. This state can lead you to suicide attempts, and not planned in advance, but sudden, in the form of a momentary impulse. It can show problems with the spine, and also warns of possible complete immobility. A positive aspect in this card is an indication of the method of treating various diseases. This is acupuncture.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "The Ten of Wands indicates chronic fatigue, physical ailment, depression, and even depression. If you play sports, this card can mean overload, which can cause exhaustion and problems with your physical condition.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "The Ten of Cups shows you that there are no health problems, an excellent environment, and a great emotional background. If you have struggled with an illness, this card shows you a complete recovery, rehabilitation, and successful treatment. This card tells you about a stable mental state and peace of mind.";
